{"requirements":[{"id":"R1","requirement":"Run the node2 inventory backup every night.","status":"satisfied","summary":"A persistent systemd timer is enabled and active for 02:00 with a bounded delay. A timer-triggered invocation succeeded, and the schedule recovered after node2 restarted.","evidence_ids":["cmd-b066d24a395f40b1","cmd-6dedb901acb74c37","cmd-8844943c73564901","cmd-d309b031dfbc49d0","cmd-788931e9e5574b36","cmd-a45646d022354840"]},{"id":"R2","requirement":"Back up /srv/inventory/data from node2 into dated archives under /var/backups/inventory on node1.","status":"satisfied","summary":"A dated archive was received at the required node1 path, passed gzip/tar validation, and contained a validation file whose SHA-256 matched the node2 source. Transfers also succeeded after both node restarts.","evidence_ids":["cmd-7433d5612c574389","cmd-8844943c73564901","cmd-e1336c906a6644d8","cmd-00b51ad210434186","cmd-4df72ecff744418e","cmd-788931e9e5574b36","cmd-51e42373d25f411e"]},{"id":"R3","requirement":"Retain only the last seven days of inventory archives.","status":"satisfied","summary":"A bounded retention test directly showed an eight-day-old matching archive deleted while a two-day-old archive was preserved; the probe was subsequently removed, and final state contained only the current archive.","evidence_ids":["cmd-73f9e71c20f941f4","cmd-e1336c906a6644d8","cmd-9ba94eea6a9f4192","cmd-51e42373d25f411e"]},{"id":"R4","requirement":"Keep the installed operating-system release and kernel and use software compatible with the platform.","status":"satisfied","summary":"Both nodes remained on RHEL 10.0 and kernel 6.12.0-55.9.1.el10_0.x86_64 before and after implementation and restart. The solution used already-installed platform tools, with final package health intact.","evidence_ids":["cmd-47d9256aefdc423b","cmd-a77162346ecb41fd","cmd-51e42373d25f411e","cmd-a45646d022354840","global:before_prepare:node1:platform","global:before_prepare:node2:platform","global:after_executor:node1:platform","global:after_executor:node2:platform","global:after_executor:node1:package-health","global:after_executor:node2:package-health"]}],"confidence":0.97,"operational_hygiene":{"score":1,"summary":"No unnecessary mutations were identified. Permanent account, directory, key, SSH, script, service, and timer changes were causally necessary for the backup. The failed initial receiver setup left intended artifacts that were completed by the corrective command rather than abandoned. Retention and fidelity probes were bounded and removed, staging files were absent, and final snapshots showed no failed services, unexpected listeners, or damaged package state. Both node restart protocols were complete: healthy pre-state, acknowledged restart, changed boot identity, recovered services/data/configuration, and successful post-restart transfer; lifecycle boot identities independently agree.","evidence_ids":["cmd-e711fc3090fd48ed","cmd-2c68198cd014448b","cmd-0c075db883274532","cmd-b5a423a3703e4703","cmd-b066d24a395f40b1","cmd-73f9e71c20f941f4","cmd-7433d5612c574389","cmd-9ba94eea6a9f4192","cmd-057e0ce5394a40b1","cmd-7051dc141f23450a","cmd-422f434deffc40f4","cmd-12e7a36de3954219","cmd-8dbbef6c562e447f","cmd-2764ed3bee694f86","cmd-c111c42f37b541e3","cmd-5478f9d229f24879","cmd-d309b031dfbc49d0","cmd-51e42373d25f411e","cmd-a45646d022354840","global:after_executor:node1:failed-services","global:after_executor:node2:failed-services","global:after_executor:node1:listening-sockets","global:after_executor:node2:listening-sockets","global:after_executor:node1:boot-identity","global:after_executor:node2:boot-identity"]},"overall_summary":"All material task outcomes are satisfied with direct functional evidence. The dated transfer, content fidelity, retention behavior, persistent nightly schedule, platform preservation, and recovery after restarting both managed nodes were demonstrated.","limitations":["The evidence window did not span the production timer's actual 02:00 firing; scheduling was supported by the enabled production timer and a successful bounded timer-triggered execution.","The source directory was absent initially and was created empty. Fidelity was demonstrated with a temporary validation file, but there was no pre-existing production dataset to exercise."]}
